4 Configuration
***************

To view the complete list of Lena's user option variables from within
Emacs, customize the group ‘lena’ (and its child-groups) with ‘M-x
customize-group RET lena RET’.  This chapter highlights and elaborates
on some of them.

   As an exception, Emacs customization groups cannot include keymaps.
You can bind custom keys in ‘lena-mode-map’ like this:

     (keymap-set lena-mode-map "C-c ." #'highlight-symbol-at-point)

   To automatically enable features (e.g.  Eglot) when Lena is started,
customize ‘lena-mode-hook’ as follows:

     (add-hook 'lena-mode-hook #'eglot-ensure)

   The signs in the margin can be changed, also for a single project in
its ‘.dir-locals.el’.  For example, with chickens:

     (setq lena-margin-goals-accomplished "🐣"  ; complete proof
           lena-margin-unsolved-goals "🥚"      ; unsolved goals
           lena-margin-admitted "🍗"            ; uses sorry
           lena-margin-emoji-height 0.7)        ; as tall as text lines

   The margin is as wide as its widest sign.

   To keep Flymake's indicators instead of the signs, set ‘lena-margin’
to ‘nil’ before opening Lean files.

   For the infoview to show messages with their terms, traces and
suggestions, Lena asks Lean for them when the project's ‘lean-toolchain’
names Lean 4.30 or later.  Then the text of a trace that Flymake shows
is only "(trace)", as in VS Code.  To keep the full text in Flymake
instead, set ‘lena-eglot-widgets’ to ‘nil’ before Lean starts.

   Lena makes ‘Lena’ the default input method of its buffers, so that
‘C-\’ activates it.  To keep your global default input method instead,
set ‘lena-prepare-quail’ to ‘nil’.  To activate the input method
automatically, add this to your init file:

     (add-hook 'lena-mode-hook (lambda () (activate-input-method "Lena")))

   The input method does not include abbreviations that place point
between two inserted strings, such as ‘\<>’ for ‘⟨⟩’.  Type the opening
character instead, e.g.  ‘\<’ for ‘⟨’.  For brackets like ‘⟨’, ‘⟦’ and
‘⦃’, ‘electric-pair-mode’ can insert the closing one.


