6.2 Version 0.8.2 from 2026-02-22
=================================

   • Improved rules for Font-Lock: Highlight identifiers in their
     definitions.  For example, in “def foo : Nat := 123”, ‘foo’ will be
     highlighted (via Font-Lock).


